/*
 * sync-to generator — core.entity_view_display.bb_run.bb_run.overlay
 *
 * THE OVERLAY BODY of a run, so a failed or expired run can be investigated
 * without opening a terminal. `teaser` is the row; `full` is the canonical
 * page body; this is the dialog body.
 *
 * IT NAMES THE SAME COMPONENTS AS THE ENTITY MAPPING, and that is a checked
 * statement rather than a convention: `data-display-components.sh` check B7
 * reads the addresses out of `entity-mapping/bb_run.bb_run.overlay.jsonata`
 * and out of this whole file — comments included, in BOTH address forms —
 * and fails when the two sets differ. The mapping composes the body from
 * exactly `list`, `zone` and `log-viewer`, so this generator names exactly
 * those three. No fourth address may be written down here, not even in prose.
 */
